Hi Tom,

Thank you for the counter and the volume figure, that helps. I have passed bo=
th to our pricing team. +3% will be difficult for us, as our own cost base is=
 going up more than that, but the 1,800 TEU commitment is a good argument on =
our side. I expect to come back to you with a revised proposal by 29 October.

Our offer deadline of 30 November remains unchanged.

Best, Pia

Best regards,
Pia Lindqvist
Account manager at Nordline (freight forwarder)

